Below is an example implementation of a Kotlin coroutine that downloads multiple files concurrently from a given list of URLs. This example includes proper error handling and cancellation support.

### Dependencies

To run this code, ensure you have the following dependencies in your `build.gradle` file (if you're using Gradle) or your `pom.xml` file (if you're using Maven):

